From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jay Leaton <58495321+jayleaton@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 16:07:35 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 57/79] compute lane: a resumed segment that ends inside its
 reopened think block answers with that text

With thinking on, the turn after a tool result opens a new think block. When the model answered
there and stopped without closing it, the whole answer went out as reasoning_content and the
reply's content was empty (Qwen3.8-Flash-Next: 3 of ~360 lane replies). A resumed segment
(compute_segments.next) that ends at its EOS with no think close and no content now reports its
text as the content, streamed or not.

(cherry picked from commit 751b92d4d5b569bce42fe2170064f8241bf2b6b6)
